{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luxury cruise gone astray. A shattered world waiting below.</strong><br>When the <i>GalactiX-1</i>\u00a0a deep-space pleasure liner vanishes into a gravitational storm, you awaken among its wreckage on a chain of floating islands adrift in an alien sky. With only your <strong>jetpack, grapple,</strong> and will to survive, you\u2019ll explore the fragments of paradise turned hostile, searching for survivors, supplies, and the truth behind the anomaly that tore your ship apart.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore. Rescue. Adapt.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse vast, handcrafted biomes suspended above the void. Leap between cliffs, glide through storms, and uncover relics of the crash scattered across impossible terrain. Each rescue brings new voices, upgrades, and story threads that reshape your journey home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/47b6130b67150d3b8f2f2dfa23fa3c68.poster.avif?t=1769354220\" width=1000 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/47b6130b67150d3b8f2f2dfa23fa3c68.webm?t=1769354220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/47b6130b67150d3b8f2f2dfa23fa3c68.mp4?t=1769354220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Jetpack &amp; Grapple Mobility</strong>\u00a0- Experience total freedom across vast, vertical islands suspended in alien skies. Whether you charge headlong into danger or chart a patient route from above, your approach defines the journe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/5e63db6d271028b82d2303d6dce9852e.poster.avif?t=1769354220\" width=1000 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/5e63db6d271028b82d2303d6dce9852e.webm?t=1769354220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/5e63db6d271028b82d2303d6dce9852e.mp4?t=1769354220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Playstyles</strong>\u00a0- Choose your pace and philosophy. Move fast and fearless, diving into risky rescues, or take a calculated, deliberate path; scouting, planning, and executing extractions on your own terms. The world rewards both instinct and intention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/8d1c2e503463a4dae123fad2193feefb.poster.avif?t=1769354220\" width=1000 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/8d1c2e503463a4dae123fad2193feefb.webm?t=1769354220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/8d1c2e503463a4dae123fad2193feefb.mp4?t=1769354220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth &amp; Survival</strong>\u00a0- You\u2019re not alone out there. Enemies stalk the terrain, drawn to movement and sound. Use foliage for cover, outmaneuver patrols, set ambushes, or avoid conflict entirely. Every encounter is a choice between fight, flight, or fade into the mist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/d5a4f375f59856bc45c6b4b6d62b74fa.poster.avif?t=1769354220\" width=1000 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/d5a4f375f59856bc45c6b4b6d62b74fa.webm?t=1769354220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/d5a4f375f59856bc45c6b4b6d62b74fa.mp4?t=1769354220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivor Extraction System</strong>\u00a0- Every life you save unlocks new upgrades, insights, and technologies. Rescue the stranded to expand your abilities and uncover fragments of the ship\u2019s story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>Evolving World Design</strong>\u00a0- Dynamic weather, day-night cycles, and unpredictable hazards keep exploration tense and alive. The environment itself can turn from ally to enemy in moments.</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable Suit Systems</strong>\u00a0- Earn node points to enhance traversal, scanning, defense, stealth and other systems, crafting a playstyle as unique as your path home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Immersion</strong>\u00a0- From the whine of your thrusters to the rustle of alien flora, every detail is designed to draw you into the haunting beauty of a broken world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4111950?t=1769354220","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4111950?t=1769354220","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/9034a4f7a25b8e520e2f9d604b0f23e42e4eb756/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769354220","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/9034a4f7a25b8e520e2f9d604b0f23e42e4eb756/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769354220","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luxury cruise gone astray. A shattered world waiting below.</strong><br>When the <i>GalactiX-1</i>\u00a0a deep-space pleasure liner vanishes into a gravitational storm, you awaken among its wreckage on a chain of floating islands adrift in an alien sky. With only your <strong>jetpack, grapple,</strong> and will to survive, you\u2019ll explore the fragments of paradise turned hostile, searching for survivors, supplies, and the truth behind the anomaly that tore your ship apart.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore. Rescue. Adapt.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse vast, handcrafted biomes suspended above the void. Leap between cliffs, glide through storms, and uncover relics of the crash scattered across impossible terrain. Each rescue brings new voices, upgrades, and story threads that reshape your journey home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/47b6130b67150d3b8f2f2dfa23fa3c68.poster.avif?t=1769354220\" width=1000 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/47b6130b67150d3b8f2f2dfa23fa3c68.webm?t=1769354220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/47b6130b67150d3b8f2f2dfa23fa3c68.mp4?t=1769354220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Jetpack &amp; Grapple Mobility</strong>\u00a0- Experience total freedom across vast, vertical islands suspended in alien skies. Whether you charge headlong into danger or chart a patient route from above, your approach defines the journe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/5e63db6d271028b82d2303d6dce9852e.poster.avif?t=1769354220\" width=1000 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/5e63db6d271028b82d2303d6dce9852e.webm?t=1769354220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/5e63db6d271028b82d2303d6dce9852e.mp4?t=1769354220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Playstyles</strong>\u00a0- Choose your pace and philosophy. Move fast and fearless, diving into risky rescues, or take a calculated, deliberate path; scouting, planning, and executing extractions on your own terms. The world rewards both instinct and intention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/8d1c2e503463a4dae123fad2193feefb.poster.avif?t=1769354220\" width=1000 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/8d1c2e503463a4dae123fad2193feefb.webm?t=1769354220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/8d1c2e503463a4dae123fad2193feefb.mp4?t=1769354220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth &amp; Survival</strong>\u00a0- You\u2019re not alone out there. Enemies stalk the terrain, drawn to movement and sound. Use foliage for cover, outmaneuver patrols, set ambushes, or avoid conflict entirely. Every encounter is a choice between fight, flight, or fade into the mist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/d5a4f375f59856bc45c6b4b6d62b74fa.poster.avif?t=1769354220\" width=1000 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/d5a4f375f59856bc45c6b4b6d62b74fa.webm?t=1769354220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/extras/d5a4f375f59856bc45c6b4b6d62b74fa.mp4?t=1769354220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivor Extraction System</strong>\u00a0- Every life you save unlocks new upgrades, insights, and technologies. Rescue the stranded to expand your abilities and uncover fragments of the ship\u2019s story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>Evolving World Design</strong>\u00a0- Dynamic weather, day-night cycles, and unpredictable hazards keep exploration tense and alive. The environment itself can turn from ally to enemy in moments.</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable Suit Systems</strong>\u00a0- Earn node points to enhance traversal, scanning, defense, stealth and other systems, crafting a playstyle as unique as your path home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Immersion</strong>\u00a0- From the whine of your thrusters to the rustle of alien flora, every detail is designed to draw you into the haunting beauty of a broken world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Endurion Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111950/0ed88b5fd63199f8e6d5c471afe5b7788f397704/header.jpg?t=1769354220","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4111950/51546330/c7b3753c4d4fabb1662012f405430ec4b183a6e0/1763332169/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763332726","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4111950/51546330/c7b3753c4d4fabb1662012f405430ec4b183a6e0/1763332169/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763332726","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4111950/51546330/c7b3753c4d4fabb1662012f405430ec4b183a6e0/1763332169/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763332726","id":257232816,"name":"Find Them Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257232816/c42486a98e4242cea2fd47f57126002b4f2381a9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763332726"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4111950/88722356/7dd9a0ef978498444c0f830e02ab7f78086ddec3/1762114884/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762366903","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4111950/88722356/7dd9a0ef978498444c0f830e02ab7f78086ddec3/1762114884/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762366903","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4111950/88722356/7dd9a0ef978498444c0f830e02ab7f78086ddec3/1762114884/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762366903","id":257225851,"name":"Explore Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257225851/e70780ebd10bcfc301685bcd2fa79ee09794c757/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762366903"}],"name":"Horizons Light","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</st